        <h1>Fast by layers.</h1>
        <p class="article-lede">
          FocalVector became fast through a sequence of optimizations—HNSW,
          quantization, SIMD, parallel construction, memory mapping, incremental
          persistence, and optional CUDA. The harder part was making sure every
          faster path still answered the same question.
        </p>
        <div class="article-byline">
          <span>By Steve Weiler</span>
          <time datetime="2026-08-02">August 2, 2026</time>
          <span>10 minute read</span>
        </div>
      </header>

